{"seq":3,"slug":"vit-vs-cnn","title":"ViT 与 CNN 对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/foundations/vit-vs-cnn","wordCount":1366,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"vit-与-cnn-对比\">ViT 与 CNN 对比</h1><p>「ViT 取代 CNN 了吗」是个被问烂却答错的问题。正确的答案不是「是」或「否」，而是「看你有多少数据、多大算力、要做什么任务」。这一篇把 ViT 与卷积网络放在四个具体维度上逐条比，给出可操作的选型判断，而不是站队。前一篇 <a href=\"why-vision-transformers\">为何视觉 Transformer</a> 已经讲过 ViT 的核心赌注，这里聚焦在「同台对比」上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四个维度上的此消彼长\">核心概念：四个维度上的此消彼长</h2><p>ViT 与 CNN 的高下不是单一答案，而是在四个维度上各有胜负：归纳偏置、感受野、数据效率、计算复杂度。这一篇的结构就是逐维度拆开比，最后收成一张选型决策表。记住一条总纲——没有谁绝对更强，只有「在你的数据量、算力、任务下谁更合适」。下面从最根本的归纳偏置说起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归纳偏置-先验的多与少\">归纳偏置：先验的多与少</h2><p>最根本的区别是模型内建了多少关于图像的先验。CNN 内建两条强先验——局部性（卷积核只看邻域）和平移等变性（权值空间共享）。ViT 几乎不内建空间先验，唯一残留的局部性来自分块（一个 patch 内的像素被绑定），patch 之间则完全靠数据学出来的注意力关系连接。</p>\n<p>先验多的好处是「样本效率高」：CNN 不必从数据里重新发现「邻近像素相关」，所以小数据也学得稳。坏处是「灵活性低」：当数据足以支撑更复杂的关系结构时，固定先验成了天花板。ViT 反过来——先验少、灵活高、但饿数据。这条权衡贯穿全 hub，也是 ViT 需要 <a href=\"../practice/vit-pretraining\">预训练 (MAE/DINO)</a> 这类无标注预训练来「喂饱」的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"感受野与全局关系-层层撑大-vs-一步到位\">感受野与全局关系：层层撑大 vs 一步到位</h2><p>CNN 的感受野随深度缓慢增长。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 卷积单层只看 9 个像素，要覆盖全图需要堆很多层，所以 CNN 对全局关系的建模是「间接且迟来」的——浅层只能看局部纹理，全局语义要到深层才浮现。</p>\n<p>ViT 的自注意力则在每一层都让任意两个 patch 直接交互，全局关系「天生即时」。形式上，自注意力对每对位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i,j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 计算相关度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{ij} = \\mathrm{softmax}_j\\!\\left(\\frac{q_i \\cdot k_j}{\\sqrt{d}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9934em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5335em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9378em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8978em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1022em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5073em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.538em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，第一层就能让左上 patch 关注右下 patch。代价是这种全连接要算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对关系，复杂度随 token 数平方增长，机制细节见 <a href=\"../architecture/self-attention-vision\">视觉自注意力</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[CNN: 感受野随深度增长] --&gt; B[浅层只看局部纹理]&#10;  B --&gt; C[深层才汇出全局语义]&#10;  C --&gt; D[全局关系: 间接 迟来]&#10;  E[ViT: 每层全局自注意力] --&gt; F[任意两 patch 直接交互]&#10;  F --&gt; G[第一层即建立全局关系]&#10;  G --&gt; H[代价: 算 N^2 对关系]\">flowchart TD\n  A[CNN: 感受野随深度增长] --&gt; B[浅层只看局部纹理]\n  B --&gt; C[深层才汇出全局语义]\n  C --&gt; D[全局关系: 间接 迟来]\n  E[ViT: 每层全局自注意力] --&gt; F[任意两 patch 直接交互]\n  F --&gt; G[第一层即建立全局关系]\n  G --&gt; H[代价: 算 N^2 对关系]</pre><h2 id=\"数据效率与计算复杂度-两条交叉曲线\">数据效率与计算复杂度：两条交叉曲线</h2><p>把数据效率和算力放一起看，会出现两条交叉曲线。数据维度上，存在一个规模拐点：ImageNet-1k 量级（约 128 万）ViT 不如同算力 CNN，到 ImageNet-21k（1400 万）、JFT-300M（3 亿）才反超。算力维度上，CNN 的卷积开销随输入分辨率近似线性，ViT 的自注意力随 token 数平方——高分辨率下 ViT 迅速变贵。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>CNN</th>\n<th>ViT</th>\n<th>谁占优</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>小数据从头训练</td>\n<td>稳、不易过拟合</td>\n<td>易过拟合、需强增广</td>\n<td>CNN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大数据预训练</td>\n<td>较早触顶</td>\n<td>持续随数据/参数提升</td>\n<td>ViT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局关系建模</td>\n<td>间接、需深层</td>\n<td>直接、每层全局</td>\n<td>ViT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高分辨率算力</td>\n<td>近似线性</td>\n<td>平方增长</td>\n<td>CNN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密集预测多尺度特征</td>\n<td>天然金字塔</td>\n<td>需 Swin 类改造</td>\n<td>CNN（或层次化 ViT）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性（注意力图）</td>\n<td>需额外方法</td>\n<td>注意力图天然可视</td>\n<td>ViT</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「高分辨率平方增长」和「缺多尺度特征」这两条劣势，正是 <a href=\"../variants/hierarchical-swin\">层次化 (Swin)</a> 要补的——它用开窗把复杂度降到线性，又像 CNN 一样产出特征金字塔。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型判断-什么时候用哪个\">选型判断：什么时候用哪个</h2><p>把上面几条收成一张可操作的决策。数据量小（万级到十万级）且无现成预训练权重，优先 CNN 或带强归纳偏置的混合架构。能拿到大规模预训练权重（如 DINOv3、CLIP 的 ViT 骨干）做迁移，ViT 往往是上限更高的选择。任务是高分辨率密集预测（分割、检测），别用纯 ViT，用 Swin 这类层次化变体或混合架构。边缘部署、强实时、算力紧，权衡延迟后混合或轻量 CNN 常更划算，理由见 <a href=\"../practice/vit-deployment\">部署与边界</a>。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是，2026 年的实践里「纯 ViT vs 纯 CNN」的二分本身在淡化——大量 SOTA 骨干是混合的，早期卷积补局部先验、后期注意力建全局关系，这条路线在 <a href=\"../variants/hybrid-conv-attention\">卷积注意力混合</a> 里详谈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>区别的根在归纳偏置：CNN 先验多、样本效率高但灵活性低；ViT 先验少、灵活高但饿数据。</li>\n<li>感受野上 CNN 靠深度层层撑大、全局关系迟来，ViT 每层全局直接交互、代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度。</li>\n<li>存在数据规模拐点（中等数据 CNN 胜、大数据 ViT 胜）与算力曲线（高分辨率 CNN 占优）两条交叉关系。</li>\n<li>选型按「数据量 / 是否有预训练 / 任务类型 / 部署约束」四问决定，2026 年混合架构正在抹平这条二分。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>ViT 的核心动机与数据拐点：<a href=\"why-vision-transformers\">为何视觉 Transformer</a></li>\n<li>平方复杂度的来源：<a href=\"../architecture/self-attention-vision\">视觉自注意力</a></li>\n<li>把卷积先验请回 ViT：<a href=\"../variants/hybrid-conv-attention\">卷积注意力混合</a></li>\n<li>经典卷积架构（跨 hub）：<a href=\"../../deep-learning/convolutional-networks/classic-architectures\">深度学习 · 经典架构</a></li>\n<li>迁移学习在视觉中的实践（跨 hub）：<a href=\"../../computer-vision/image-classification/transfer-learning-cv\">计算机视觉 · 迁移学习</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ViT 与 CNN 对比","id":"vit-与-cnn-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四个维度上的此消彼长","id":"核心概念-四个维度上的此消彼长"},{"level":2,"text":"归纳偏置：先验的多与少","id":"归纳偏置-先验的多与少"},{"level":2,"text":"感受野与全局关系：层层撑大 vs 一步到位","id":"感受野与全局关系-层层撑大-vs-一步到位"},{"level":2,"text":"数据效率与计算复杂度：两条交叉曲线","id":"数据效率与计算复杂度-两条交叉曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"选型判断：什么时候用哪个","id":"选型判断-什么时候用哪个"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"图像分块与嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/foundations/patch-embedding"},"next":{"title":"视觉自注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/architecture/self-attention-vision"}}